# Prebuilt Mongoose OS libraries the migration firmware links: these four
# libraries ship without sources and are fetched from their "latest" GitHub
# releases. scripts/fetch-prebuilt.sh downloads them and checks these SHA-256
# digests, so the build fails if upstream ever replaces a file.
